id=mipad_dpin_guard
name=Mipad DP-in Callback Guard
version=0.1.0
versionCode=100
author=Mipad DP Touch contributors
description=Guard the display-feature HAL so DfMS can register its DP-IN callback before onBootPhase(500). Read-only besides an idempotent HAL start; never touches the touch module, HID, UDC or /odm.
